    "detailed_description": "<h1>Join Our Discord</h1><p>[/url]</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>[h2]Support us by Wishlisting[/h2]\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" webp=\"\"][/imgvid]\nHello I am Brian and this is my first publicly released game, thanks for checking it out!\n[b]Kitsune Battlemage[/b] is an intense elemental magic combat game where you're not limited to any specific school or style of magic. Choose your abilities and wage battle using powerful combinations of elemental spells! \n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\"][/imgvid]\n\n[b]Choose[/b] abilities from any of the elements and switch things up to engage in tactical spellcasting battles.\n [imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\"][/imgvid]\n\n[b]Battlemages[/b] enter the training grounds via portals that connect worlds. Train your skills against others in elemental combat!\n[imgvid poster.avif=\"\" webm=\"\" mp4=\"\"][/imgvid]\n\n[b]Master [/b]the elements: Fire, Frost, and Earth. Choose your abilities to match your playstyle, fit your team, and battle your opponents!\n\n[b]KEY FEATURES:[/b]\n[list]\n[*]Online arena combat\n[*]Offline horde mode\n[*]Choose any combination of Fire, Earth, and Ice magic\n[*]Health, mana, and stamina resources that can be attacked via different skills\n[*]Primary attacks have stacking buffs and debuffs\n[/list</p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Support us by Wishlisting</h2><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/c4780c718efaa856fe4a8bc6b57188fb.poster.avif?t=1708977933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/c4780c718efaa856fe4a8bc6b57188fb.webm?t=1708977933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div><br>Hello I am Brian and this is my first publicly released game, thanks for checking it out!<br><strong>Kitsune Battlemage</strong> is an intense elemental magic combat game where you're not limited to any specific school or style of magic. Choose your abilities and wage battle using powerful combinations of elemental spells! <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/01970cd4a0b51082723f18d4a96fc535.poster.avif?t=1708977933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/01970cd4a0b51082723f18d4a96fc535.webm?t=1708977933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/01970cd4a0b51082723f18d4a96fc535.mp4?t=1708977933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Choose</strong> abilities from any of the elements and switch things up to engage in tactical spellcasting battles.<br> <div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/91116482146c5b46bb725adcd4022e0a.poster.avif?t=1708977933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/91116482146c5b46bb725adcd4022e0a.webm?t=1708977933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/91116482146c5b46bb725adcd4022e0a.mp4?t=1708977933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Battlemages</strong> enter the training grounds via portals that connect worlds. Train your skills against others in elemental combat!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/c02b5b8ed3af1f1048baed6381296cd9.poster.avif?t=1708977933\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/c02b5b8ed3af1f1048baed6381296cd9.webm?t=1708977933\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1851840/extras/c02b5b8ed3af1f1048baed6381296cd9.mp4?t=1708977933\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Master </strong>the elements: Fire, Frost, and Earth. Choose your abilities to match your playstyle, fit your team, and battle your opponents!<br><br><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Online arena combat<br></li><li>Offline horde mode<br></li><li>Choose any combination of Fire, Earth, and Ice magic<br></li><li>Health, mana, and stamina resources that can be attacked via different skills<br></li><li>Primary attacks have stacking buffs and debuffs</li></ul>",
